## The key idea to remember

Think of a struct as a **blueprint for related data**.

```text
                 Rust Struct
                     │
        ┌────────────┼────────────┐
        ↓            ↓            ↓
      field        field        field
        │            │            │
       id          name         email
```

And as you progress into backend development:

```text
HTTP JSON
   ↓
Deserialize
   ↓
Request Struct
   ↓
Service
   ↓
Database
   ↓
Model Struct
   ↓
Response Struct
   ↓
Serialize
   ↓
HTTP JSON
```

**That pipeline is one of the most important things to understand about structs for your Rust backend journey.**
